:29.613" end="00:29.916">I</span> <span begin="00:29.916" end="00:30.431">said,</span> <span begin="00:30.431" end="00:31.196">"I</span> <span begin="00:31.196" end="00:31.612">can't</span> <span begin="00:31.612" end="00:32.498">stay,</span> <span begin="00:32.498" end="00:32.635">do</span> <span begin="00:32.635" end="00:32.808">I</span> <span begin="00:32.808" end="00:33.135">have</span> <span begin="00:33.135" end="00:33.290">to</span> <span begin="00:33.290" end="00:33.760">give</span> <span begin="00:33.760" end="00:33.897">a</span> <span begin="00:33.897" end="00:34.521">reason?"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说了我不能留下</span></p><p begin="00:34.570" end="00:38.188" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:34.570" end="00:34.891">It's</span> <span begin="00:34.891" end="00:35.308">just</span> <span begin="00:35.308" end="00:35.879">me,</span> <span begin="00:35.879" end="00:36.504">me,</span> <span begin="00:36.504" end="00:36.843">me,</span> <span begin="00:36.843" end="00:37.146">it's</span> <span begin="00:37.146" end="00:37.331">what</span> <span begin="00:37.331" end="00:37.735">I</span> <span begin="00:37.735" end="00:38.188">want</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是</span></p><p begin="00:39.788" end="00:41.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:39.788" end="00:40.181">So</span> <span begin="00:40.181" end="00:40.353">how</span> <span begin="00:40.353" end="00:40.453">did</span> <span begin="00:40.453" end="00:40.553">we</span> <span begin="00:40.553" end="00:40.788">get</span> <span begin="00:40.788" end="00:41.450">here?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们到底是怎么走到今天这一步的</span></p><p begin="00:42.297" end="00:44.521" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:42.297" end="00:42.600">Three</span> <span begin="00:42.600" end="00:42.898">weeks</span> <span begin="00:42.898" end="00:43.195">now,</span> <span begin="00:43.195" end="00:43.362">we've</span> <span begin="00:43.362" end="00:43.540">been</span> <span begin="00:43.540" end="00:43.981">so</span> <span begin="00:43.981" end="00:44.332">caught</span> <span begin="00:44.332" end="00:44.521">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">三个星期了 我们一直都这么困扰</span></p><p begin="00:44.750" end="00:47.838" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:44.750" end="00:45.238">Better</span> <span begin="00:45.238" end="00:45.422">if</span> <span begin="00:45.422" end="00:45.684">we</span> <span begin="00:45.684" end="00:46.101">do</span> <span begin="00:46.101" end="00:46.755">this</span> <span begin="00:46.755" end="00:46.933">on</span> <span begin="00:46.933" end="00:47.136">our</span> <span begin="00:47.136" end="00:47.838">own</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也许我们分开会更好</span></p><p begin="00:48.898" end="00:51.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:48.898" end="00:49.261">Before</span> <span begin="00:49.261" end="00:49.499">I</span> <span begin="00:49.499" end="00:49.784">love</span> <span begin="00:49.784" end="00:50.243">you,</span> <span begin="00:50.243" end="00:50.528">na,</span> <span begin="00:50.528" end="00:50.849">na,</span> <span begin="00:50.849" end="00:51.334">na</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱上你之前</span></p><p begin="00:51.353" end="00:53.607" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:51.353" end="00:51.460">I'm</span> <span begin="00:51.460" end="00:52.013">gonna</span> <span begin="00:52.013" end="00:52.275">leave</span> <span begin="00:52.275" end="00:52.709">you,</span> <span begin="00:52.709" end="00:53.001">na,</span> <span begin="00:53.001" end="00:53.334">na,</span> <span begin="00:53.334" end="00:53.607">na</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要离开你</span></p><p begin="00:53.705" end="00:56.075" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:53.705" end="00:54.383">Before</span> <span begin="00:54.383" end="00:54.483">I'm</span> <span begin="00:54.